{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_title", "source_sha256": "69d40a1e01548c0769ef125515aae0115254248ca2573b38e90e365ac3322eab", "ja": "春香とおでかけ1", "zh": "和春香外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ae4bf88174a7ae40e50fa4c26def3a5f34c9b9400c8f3330dd3b3fb5c9fbba3c", "ja": "春香とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "这是和春香一起出门的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "491f10fe7e295d444250964222d1ba90df1e2cf241c9780f94c2d6fc6cfb7e4c", "ja": "（風情溢れる茶屋街……。春香がイベントに\n呼ばれたのが、まさかここだったとは）", "zh": "（古色古香的茶屋街……没想到春香被邀请参加的活动，居然是在这里。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "6e660829fcfc3e4e05970563073ea1db1ef937eaa8131bb2f9e431be9d14e114", "ja": "わぁ……来ちゃいましたね、金沢！\nここって、紬ちゃんのお家の近くなんですよね？", "zh": "哇……我们来到金泽了呢！这里就在小紬家附近，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "25a75bef79965abfe44c3c2415a9c9d0d32fb1ed156fd10bf00ccfdcbfa4d72e", "ja": "ああ、今回のイベントにも関わっているらしい。\nあとで挨拶に行こうと思ってるんだけど……。", "zh": "听说她似乎也参与了这次活动。\n我打算之后去打个招呼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "5deb40fdf3254914583b9e149b84ca3f1b3188fa310c642bde891fd8de09cda7", "ja": "紬ちゃんが頑張ってること、伝えなきゃですもんね♪\n私も、イベントのお仕事頑張らなくちゃ。", "zh": "毕竟得把紬努力的事告诉她才行嘛♪我也得努力做好活动的工作才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "913bc52be08e83af10b1a502e67f75c7d7e2332ccb99e508399ad0b716ce7a08", "ja": "同じ事務所のアイドルとして、恥ずかしいところは\n見せられませんからね！　えへへ。", "zh": "作为同一家事务所的偶像，可不能\n表现得很丢人呢！诶嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "76acd38fe07dd704f83d02c57636d0fb2df32ea97bef48fb8b6c54d231edfcf4", "ja": "春香なら大丈夫だよ。……おっと、そろそろ時間だな。\nそれじゃ春香、また後で！", "zh": "春香没问题的。……哎，差不多该出发了。\n那么春香，待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "99e21f4fe8a69d1a21818d044b4cea1cc3f9e5a19b5aa15fe59381341649db34", "ja": "はい！\n{$P$}さん、また後で！", "zh": "好的！\n{$P$}先生，待会儿见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "b6a3ade054e3dd7c54bbdef0773640ae53c4584768bf348216d5061c63b9ae3d", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様でした……\nうう……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦了……\n呜呜……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "f57f20570f00a76b62a2b91973bd3a78c0c4fce4066aca4adbba4cdce878beea", "ja": "春香、そう落ち込まなくても……イベント自体は\n大成功だったし、みんな喜んでくれたじゃないか。", "zh": "春香，别这么沮丧嘛……演出本身\n大获成功，大家都很开心不是吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "f162f9159f865fff13c6659707e33e10294d01853fd9544110a997538925fda3", "ja": "はい……それは、本当に良かったと思うんですけど。\nなのに、最後の最後で転んじゃうなんて……。", "zh": "是的……我也觉得那真的很不错，可是……  \n偏偏在最后关头摔倒了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1ffd988309795a21936ffa7180833a0cc0c87255a0950de1a79202898b0c43c1", "ja": "とにかく、ケガがなくて良かったよ。それに、\n金沢の事、たくさん勉強してくれたんだな。", "zh": "总之，没受伤真是太好了。而且，你还认真了解了不少金泽的事情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "0add3384d3e5611f8be899ed43b32f31639c83c77f67b73db952bffb7894c4b4", "ja": "あっ、はい！　歴史の深い街だって聞いていたので……\n少しでも、話についていけるようにと思って！", "zh": "啊，是的！我听说这是座历史悠久的城市……  \n所以想着至少也要稍微做点功课，免得跟不上话题！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0235_story_001har01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_001har01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "ef7b6b901ec9fa7f8e25ac7cb73c91073b42ddd9637258d80eb8ffbae316c88c", "ja": "（それから春香に、金沢の話を聞いた。春香なら\nこの土地と同じくらい、たくさん歴史を作れるだろう）", "zh": "（之后，我听春香聊了聊金泽。要是春香的话，一定也能创造出和这片土地一样丰富的历史吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
